WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:15.324
The console is stretto's management plane: a web app on your own machine.

2
00:00:15.824 --> 00:00:19.623
It reads the files stretto writes, through stretto's own code.

3
00:00:21.423 --> 00:00:23.983
The overview counts this week's sessions,

4
00:00:23.983 --> 00:00:26.868
and the agent's calls and the lookups flows served.

5
00:00:27.318 --> 00:00:33.137
Below, each domain: a server's name, with its sessions, flows and registry entry.

6
00:00:34.837 --> 00:00:38.577
Servers lists the MCP servers stretto fronts:

7
00:00:38.577 --> 00:00:41.259
recording, in shadow, or serving a flow.

8
00:00:41.709 --> 00:00:45.709
Each shows what stretto init prints, to paste into your host.

9
00:00:45.709 --> 00:00:47.730
The console never edits your host.

10
00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:53.111
Test the connection, and it lists the server's tools, each marked read or write.

11
00:00:54.811 --> 00:00:59.314
Sessions lists every recording: served, in shadow, or recorded.

12
00:00:59.764 --> 00:01:01.704
Open a served one.

13
00:01:01.704 --> 00:01:05.263
After the agent's first call, the flow read ahead three times.

14
00:01:05.713 --> 00:01:10.200
Each lookup shows its chance, times its binding, against the threshold.

15
00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:14.523
Decisions lists them all, with where the flow handed back, and why.

16
00:01:14.973 --> 00:01:19.196
In shadow, it shows what the flow would have read, with nothing looked up.

17
00:01:20.896 --> 00:01:26.294
A flow's page draws its graph: the calls it decides after, and the reads it makes.

18
00:01:26.744 --> 00:01:31.760
Move the threshold to 0.5, and one of its three sites hands back.

19
00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:35.370
Review renders the flow for a reviewer.

20
00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:37.558
Compare shows what changed against another.

21
00:01:39.258 --> 00:01:44.627
Jobs run the stretto CLI from the page: learn, promote, audit, and more.

22
00:01:45.077 --> 00:01:48.817
Here, an audit of the shop flow on its served sessions.

23
00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:50.609
The report opens in place.

24
00:01:52.309 --> 00:01:56.247
Control K jumps to any page, server, session or flow.

25
00:01:56.697 --> 00:01:59.908
Start it read-only, and it refuses every change.

26
00:02:01.908 --> 00:02:06.880
Run it with make console in a checkout, or in a container with docker compose.
